# Line endings are not cosmetic here. `cadkit/` bind-mounts this tree into a Linux container and
# the shell scripts are executed there; a CRLF shebang fails with `\r: command not found`, which
# reads as a missing interpreter rather than as a line-ending problem. core.autocrlf is true on
# the Windows box this repo is developed on, so without this file a fresh clone would check out
# CRLF copies of every script. Normalise to LF in the repo AND in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Things that must never be touched by text conversion.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.gif   binary
*.glb   binary
*.stl   binary
*.step  binary
*.stp   binary
*.FCStd binary
*.gguf  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.sqlite binary
